<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak Jan-Aug budget deficit SKK 7.94 bln.</title>
<headline>Slovak Jan-Aug budget deficit SKK 7.94 bln.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovakia's state budget deficit widened to 7.94 billion crowns for the January-August period from a 6.09 billion crown deficit in the first seven months, the Slovak Statistical Bureau (SUSR) said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>  SLOVAK STATE BUDGET  Jan-Aug     Jan-July    1996 est</p>
<p>  Revenues (SKK bln)   106.459	95.853     162.425</p>
<p>  Expenditure	    114.399     101.941     189.425</p>
<p>  Balance		   -7.940	-6.088     -27.000</p>
<p>Note: 1996 estimate based on the government's budget plan which was apporoved by parliament. -- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-563-3687</p>
</text>
